---
import { AGENDA } from "../../lib/contact";
import StudioLayout from "../../layouts/StudioLayout.astro";
import CartesCas from "../../components/studio/CartesCas.astro";
import IndexRoles from "../../components/studio/IndexRoles.astro";
---
<StudioLayout
  titre="Use cases"
  description="The processes where automation with agents makes sense: calls for tender, incoming orders, customer service, invoicing, purchasing, compliance, management reporting."
  actif="cas-usages">
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Use cases</p>
    <h1>Where automation keeps its promises.</h1>
    <p class="lead">These processes have one thing in common: repetitive work whose rules only two or three people know. That&rsquo;s where automation pays, and where it can best be measured. Two ways in below: by process, or by the role that carries it.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">By process</p>
    <h2>What costs you time</h2>
    <CartesCas />
    <div class="prose" style="margin-top:48px">
      <p class="muted" style="font-size:14px">These cases are built from situations observed in these industries. The orders of magnitude are assumptions until we measure them at your company.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">By role</p>
    <h2>What weighs on your role</h2>
    <p class="lead">The same cases, arranged by the person who carries the load, so that everyone finds their own job.</p>
    <IndexRoles />
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tint">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <h2>Your case isn&rsquo;t on the list</h2>
    <p>These are the ones that come up most often, but the list stays open. The criterion isn&rsquo;t the industry, it&rsquo;s the shape of the work: a high volume of tasks that repeat.</p>
    <p>If that&rsquo;s your situation, the diagnosis will cost it like the others. <strong>And if it concludes that automation makes no sense for you, it will say so.</strong></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Find out what it&rsquo;s worth for you</h2>
    <p>45 minutes to find out whether there is enough for a diagnosis. If nothing at your company is worth automating, we&rsquo;ll tell you.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn" href={AGENDA} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a call</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/en/method/">See the method</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</StudioLayout>
